cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This is a local, unreleased intermediate working artefact, not the submission kit.
  Its source lineage is P7-R4; its current revision is APEX2 P7A. Do not cite this
  package as CodeProbe v2.3.0 and do not infer a public tag, release or DOI.
type: software
title: "CodeProbe: Evidence Gates Can Fail Separately in Heuristic Source Review - APEX2 P7A local working candidate"
authors:
  - family-names: Clim
    given-names: Antonio
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4745-0431"
    affiliation: "Bucharest University of Economic Studies"
version: "P7-R4-review-candidate+a2p7a.1"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Local unreleased review package binding nine bounded claims to executable
  obligations, live counterexamples, deterministic outputs and a SHA-256
  results manifest. The public CodeProbe v2.3.0 release is retained separately
  under source/ as lineage and is not the identity of this package.
keywords:
  - software quality
  - evidence gates
  - claims-as-tests
  - result provenance
  - computational reproducibility
